[test/e2e_node/device_plugin_test.go] @ffromani  and @pohly PTAL , i have two successive green runs in https://prow.k8s.io/view/gs/kubernetes-ci-logs/pr-logs/pull/138289/pull-kubernetes-node-kubelet-serial-device-manager/2044426803413520384 and https://prow.k8s.io/view/gs/kubernetes-ci-logs/pr-logs/pull/138289/pull-kubernetes-node-kubelet-serial-device-manager/2044405156652519424 . Long story short , most of the changes are in the mockup device driver , checking kubelet and ginkgo logs , i notice that some errors where because kubelet was not up and running when the unix socket towards kubelet was created  , while others where because there was not delay between the calls creating a mockup grpc server.  

The pending failure in containerd i am waiting to see if the extra timeout i have added will help to overcome it.

@pohly i have pinged you as reviewer since i have followed your code in DRA testing and it seems your experience could be useful here, i believe.

