I could create a simple func that we can use in all places and belongs to the CPU manager package, so it is easier to follow why that check is in `pkg/kubelet/cm/container_manager_linux.go`:
```
func (p *staticPolicy) IsIntegerCPUAmount(cpuQuantity resource.Quantity) bool {
	return cpuQuantity.Value()*1000 != cpuQuantity.MilliValue()
}
