[pkg/kubelet/cm/container_manager_linux.go] this check about integral resource is recurring anyway and belongs to the cpumanager. Conceptually, the cpumanager knows if a given  pod/container qualifies for exclusive resource allocation, and the other parts of the systme should not second guess nor duplicate the logic if we can help it. And I think we can help, adding a function like this in `cpumanager`:
