- remove commit #2, keep sourceReady, defer improvements to https://github.com/kubernetes/kubernetes/pull/137919
- squash the remaining 2 commits together
- record in the commit message the rationale currently spread between review and issue comments, to document why the map can return stale data, making the check to fail
- I'd like to have a small API change to containermap (which is used internally in exactly 3 call sites anyway) to optionally stop early instead of always do a full scan, but this is not mandatory
- we should have more unit tests to cover this function. In this specific case the existing e2e coverage is sufficient and we are refining the implementation of an existing function.

