that seems tricky to follow... we could hoist the "did allocated/reservedFor change" check out and make that switch between authorizing binding and authorizing device statuses

```go
	if utilfeature.DefaultFeatureGate.Enabled(features.DRAResourceClaimGranularStatusAuthorization) {
		if resourceutils.BindingChanged(newClaim.Status, oldClaim.Status) {
			errs = append(errs, resourceutils.AuthorizedForBinding(ctx, field.NewPath("status", "allocation"), r.authorizer, newClaim.Status, oldClaim.Status)...)
		} else {
			// if allocation/reservedFor is not being changed, authorize any device status changes.
