[pkg/scheduler/framework/plugins/dynamicresources/dynamicresources.go] I also think that unexported fields are not included in JSON output.

At the moment, `bindingConditionsStatus` is converted to a string via `formatBCStatusOneLine()`, so we are not producing JSON output right now. However, considering that we might want to support JSON output in the future, I see some benefits in keeping the fields exported.

@pohly 
If we take exporting fields for JSON output into account, do you think we would also need to export `bindingConditionsStatus` itself?

@macsko 
What’s your view on keeping the fields exported?

